5,0,1,talk,Daisuke,,"Um... hello. I'm not very good at this, but I'll try my best.","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Shion,,"Let's keep this efficient. Logic should dictate our decisions, not vague feelings.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,0,1,talk,Shunichi,,"Logic, huh? How adorable. I'm sure your ""perfect"" logic will save us all from the wolf.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,0,1,talk,Midori,,Hello everyone. It's nice to meet you. I hope we can all get along and work together peacefully.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,0,1,talk,George,,Good day. I believe a balance of observation and patience is best. Let us not rush into judgment.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,0,2,talk,Daisuke,,I... I agree with George. Maybe we should just listen to each other first.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,0,2,talk,Shion,,"Listening is fine, but without a framework for analysis, we're just wasting time. We need to track contradictions.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,0,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, you're so intense. Relax. The wolf is probably laughing at how predictable you are.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,0,2,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, let's try to be kind. @Shion is just trying to help us win. We should support each other.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Shunichi"",""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,George,,"Kindness is a virtue, Midori, but we must remain vigilant. Experience tells me that the quietest voices often hide the most.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Daisuke,,@George... do you mean me? I'm sorry if I'm being too quiet.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,0,3,talk,Shion,,"Don't apologize, Daisuke. Being quiet is a variable. What matters is how you react when pressured.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,0,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Oh, look at the interrogation already starting. This is going to be a delightful little circus.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,0,3,talk,Midori,,Let's not make anyone feel uncomfortable. Maybe we can decide on a way to share information that feels fair to everyone?,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,George,,A fair system is good. I suggest we observe the patterns of speech for the first day before making any accusations.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,0,4,talk,Daisuke,,That sounds... safe. I'll follow whatever the group decides is best.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,0,4,talk,Shion,,"Fine. We observe for now. But remember, the wolf will try to blend in. I'll be watching for any slip-ups.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,0,4,talk,Shunichi,,"I'm sure you'll be watching very closely. I'll try my best to be ""suspicious"" just for your entertainment.","{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,0,4,talk,Midori,,I'm glad we've found some common ground. Let's just try to stay positive and trust one another.,"{""words"":17,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,0,4,talk,George,,"Trust is earned, not given. I will rely on my own observations to guide my judgment.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":true,""norm"":[{""code"":""trailing_over"",""token"":""Over"",""tail"":""Over.""}]}"
