32,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,Um... did anyone... find anything strange? I'm a bit nervous.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
33,1,1,talk,Shion,,"The Seer now has information. If the Seer is bold, they might lead us. If not, we look for behavioral shifts.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
34,1,1,talk,Shunichi,,"@Daisuke, your nervousness is almost convincing. It's a shame it's so cliché.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
35,1,1,talk,Midori,,"@Shunichi, please don't tease him. He's just being honest. I think we should be patient with everyone.","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,1,1,talk,George,,"I have observed your reactions. Some are too eager to deflect, while others are overly cautious.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,1,2,talk,Daisuke,,@George... who do you think is acting strange? I... I trust your judgment.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,1,2,talk,Shion,,"@George, don't be vague. If you've noticed a pattern, state it. Logic requires data, not hints.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,1,2,talk,Shunichi,,"@Shion, your obsession with ""data"" is practically a scream for attention. Are you trying too hard to look like a Villager?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,1,2,talk,Midori,,@Shion is just being thorough. I think it's better to have someone focused on the details than to guess randomly.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,1,2,talk,George,,"@Shunichi, your cynicism is a shield. It is a common tactic to hide behind a persona of boredom or irony.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,1,3,talk,Daisuke,,I don't know... everyone seems so sure of themselves. I feel like I'm the only one who's lost.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,1,3,talk,Shion,,@Shunichi's deflection is interesting. He attacks my personality rather than addressing the game's logic. That's a red flag.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,1,3,talk,Shunichi,,"Red flags are so colorful. Maybe I just find your rigidity amusing. It's not a crime to be bored, is it?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,1,3,talk,Midori,,I think we're getting a bit too aggressive. Let's take a breath. We don't want to execute an innocent person.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,1,3,talk,George,,"Midori's desire for peace is commendable, but it can be a convenient cloak for the Possessed to hide behind.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,1,4,talk,Daisuke,,@Midori is just being nice... right? I don't want to vote for someone who's just trying to help.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,1,4,talk,Shion,,Emotion is a distraction. Shunichi's behavior is the most inconsistent with a helpful Villager. He's creating noise to mask the signal.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,1,4,talk,Shunichi,,"If you're that desperate to find a wolf, @Shion, feel free to point your finger. I'm quite comfortable right here.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,4,talk,Midori,,"I really think we should be careful. If we rush, the wolf wins. Let's think about who we truly trust.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,1,4,talk,George,,I have seen enough for today. My experience tells me that the one who mocks the process is often the one sabotaging it.,"{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
